              highlighted: ["A","H","K","B"] },
            { text: "I say next that {A} also has to {B} the ratio triplicate of that which {C} has to {D}.",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","B","C","D"] },
            { text: "Since {A}, {H}, {K}, and {B} are four numbers in proportion,",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","H","K","B"] },
            { text: "therefore {A} has to {B} the ratio triplicate of that which {A} has to {H}.",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","B","H"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "A : B triplicate of A : H", ref: "V.Def.10" }] },
            { text: "But {A} is to {H} as {C} is to {D},",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["A","H","C","D"] },
